OL,3,ATower block arsonist jailed for setting
OL,4,Awoman alight
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who set a woman on fire inside a
OL,7,Fflat, after dousing her in petrol and
OL,8,Fvodka, has been jailed for 11 years and
OL,9,Fnine months.
OL,11,FReece Brivitt, 33, set the victim
OL,12,Falight inside a tower block flat on
OL,13,FMilton Grove, Stafford, on 22 October.
OL,15,FThe victim suffered serious burns to
OL,16,Fher chest and legs, leaving her with
OL,17,Flife-changing injuries, the court
OL,18,Fheard.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
